            "review_title": "Review at VOYAGE Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Shaun H\nPerth, Australia12 contributions\n0\n100% Michelin experience in Ho Chi Minh\nSep 2026 • Friends\nthe Michelin star guide inspectors need to visit this restaurant! Chef Jonathan Koh exceeds expectations here dish after dish. Morish details with beautifully crafted menu. Amazing service to go with it, from the moment you walk in the door, enjoying cocktails and amuse bouche on the rooftop, right throughout our meals and after the dessert.\nPerfect\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten September 30, 2026",
